  "description": "DAVNUN crystallizes in the rhombohedral crystal system with space group R -3. Reported CIF formula moiety: C84 H66 Eu12 N6 O78,6(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Eu1 (Eu) has 8 O neighbors; Eu2 (Eu) has 8 O neighbors; Eu1A (Eu) has 8 O neighbors; Eu2A (Eu) has 8 O neighbors; Eu1B (Eu) has 8 O neighbors; Eu2B (Eu) has 8 O neighbors; Eu1L (Eu) has 8 O neighbors; Eu2L (Eu) has 8 O neighbors; Eu1M (Eu) has 8 O neighbors; Eu2M (Eu) has 8 O neighbors; Eu1N (Eu) has 8 O neighbors; Eu2N (Eu) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 12 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.683-3.866 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 102.08-108.98°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Eu12(HL)6(L)6(NO3)6(H2O)12]·6H2O. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 6 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 12 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
